Package: stitchwright
Version: @VERSION@
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: MRC757 <MRC757@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libx11-6, libxft2, libxss1, libfontconfig1, fontconfig
Recommends: fonts-liberation
Homepage: https://github.com/MRC757/stitchwright
Description: turn artwork into Brother PES embroidery files
 Stitchwright converts SVG artwork, pictures and existing embroidery files into
 Brother PES files (and DST, EXP, JEF, VP3 and XXX for other machines), with a
 window for arranging the design, choosing threads, filling shapes, lettering
 and previewing the stitches. Built for the Brother PE540D (4" x 4" hoop).
